  "details": "- CVE-2025-11395: confine tar extraction to the destination directory and the\n  reads of an extracted oci-archive to its temporary directory, so a crafted\n  archive given to podman load or podman volume import can no longer create or\n  overwrite files outside of it (vendored containers/storage and\n  containers/image)\n- CVE-2026-39834: fix an endless loop when one ssh channel write is 4 GiB or\n  larger, in the golang.org/x/crypto/ssh copies vendored by podman and by the\n  bundled gvisor-tap-vsock (gvproxy)\n- CVE-2026-46597: fix a panic on a crafted padding length in an AES-GCM ssh\n  packet, in the golang.org/x/crypto/ssh copies vendored by podman and by the\n  bundled gvisor-tap-vsock (gvproxy)\n- CVE-2026-111943: rebuild against golang >= 1.22.9-1.el9_2.tuxcare.els31 to\n  stop crypto/x509 Verify from trusting compromised intermediate CAs",
